  {
   "section": "heritage",
   "items": [
    {
     "role": "eyebrow",
     "order": 0,
     "text": "About Birch Creek"
    },
    {
     "role": "heading",
     "order": 1,
     "text": "Owned by the people we cover. Run from where they live."
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 2,
     "text": "Birch Creek Health began in 1963 when a cooperative of Chippewa Valley dairy farmers, machinists, and nurses pooled premiums to cover their own families. We're still a member-governed mutual: no outside shareholders, a board elected by members, and a headquarters on the Chippewa River in Eau Claire — not a P.O. box."
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 3,
     "text": "1963"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 4,
     "text": "Founded as the Chippewa Valley Health Cooperative, 412 charter families."
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 5,
     "text": "1988"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 6,
     "text": "Renamed Birch Creek Health; coverage expands across western Wisconsin."
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 7,
     "text": "2019"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 8,
     "text": "First regional plan to publish its full medical policy library without a login."
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 9,
     "text": "2026"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 10,
     "text": "184,000 members across 21 counties. Still one headquarters, still in Eau Claire."
    },
    {
     "role": "heading",
     "order": 11,
     "text": "What member-governed means in practice"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 12,
     "text": "From our 2025 annual report to members"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 13,
     "text": "Premium dollars paid out as care"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 14,
     "text": "88.1¢ / $1"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 15,
     "text": "Surplus returned as premium credits"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 16,
     "text": "$11.2M"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 17,
     "text": "Member-elected board seats"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 18,
     "text": "9 of 9"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 19,
     "text": "Executive bonuses tied to denial rates"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 20,
     "text": "$0"
    },
